# Shadowblood Ridge: "{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}." Turn 1 it is the only land, so the ability is not offered - it needs one
# mana. Turn 3 an Island pays the {1} and the Ridge adds one black and one red: {B}{R}, the fixed pair, never two of
# one color.

[Bot1 Deck]
Shadowblood Ridge
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Shadowblood Ridge.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Shadowblood Ridge.Activate(Ability: {1}, {T}; Mana: short)
Bot1.Pass
