Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Shadowblood Ridge.Activate(Ability: {1}, {T})
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{R}
